Derived work: Decimen Optical Transfer
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The frame protocol and fountain decoder (src/protocol.ts) and the DCF2
container format (src/container.ts) are adapted from Decimen Optical Transfer
to remain wire-compatible with it:

  Decimen Optical Transfer
  Copyright (c) 2026 Evan Crawley (Bash Alarmist), with portions by Steve Dakh
